<td align="center" valign="top" style="padding:40px 42px 0px 42px;" class="em_ptrl1"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:16px; line-height:24px; color:#223341; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;" class="em_green"> 
<div id="text_01" class="mktoText"> 
<p style="text-align: center;">In this season of gratitude, we’d like to thank everyone who participated in our recent client survey. Once again, you’ve rated Flywire <span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>world class</strong></span> and provided us with valuable feedback to help further drive efficiency through our innovative products and services.<br /><br />In a word, how did you describe us?<br /><span style="color: #147bd1;"><em><strong>Easy, Efficient, Excellent &amp; Convenient to name a few.</strong></em></span><br />You made our day!<br /></p> 
</div></td> 
</tr> 
