<div id="text_02" class="mktoText"> 
<p><span style="color: #ffffff;"><a href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/what-you-need-to-know-nachas-changing-regulations?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank"><em><span style="font-size: 26px;">What you need to know</span></em></a><br /><br /></span></p> 
