<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:24px; line-height:26px; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; color:#223341; padding-top:5px; font-weight:bold;" class="em_defaultlink"> 
<div id="text_03" class="mktoText"> 
<p><span style="font-size: 24px;">Nacha’s changing regulations</span></p> 
</div></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:16px; line-height:24px; color:#223341; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; padding-top:14px;" class="em_defaultlink"> 
<div id="text_04" class="mktoText"> 
<div>
 With information circulating about Nacha’s changing regulations, we wanted to take an opportunity to share a bit about what specifically is changing, what our clients need to know, and how Flywire is responding.&nbsp; 
<br /> 
<br /> 
<span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #48b985; font-size: 18px;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong><a href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/what-you-need-to-know-nachas-changing-regulations?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank" style="color: #48b985; text-decoration: underline;">Learn more</a></strong></span></span> 
<br /> 
</div> 
</div></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:16px; line-height:24px; color:#48B985; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; padding-top:16px;" class="em_green"> 
<div id="text_05" class="mktoText"></div></td> 
</tr> 
