</table></td> 
</tr>
<tr class="mktoModule" id="Headline_With_Bull"> 
<td align="center" valign="top"> 
<table width="640" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center" style="width:640px;" class="em_wrapper" bgcolor="#223341"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" style="padding:79px 40px 0px 40px;" class="em_ptrl2"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:30px; line-height:34px; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; color:#223341; padding-top:5px; font-weight:bold;" class="em_defaultlink"> 
<div id="text_016" class="mktoText"> 
<div style="text-align: center;"> 
<span style="color: #ffffff;">Real Payers. Real Results.</span> 
<br /> 
<br /> 
<span style="font-size: 16px; color: #ffffff;">All over the globe, we help simplify payments for your institution. Read what some of our (and your) payers have to say.<br /></span> 
<br /> 
<a href="https://www.flywire.com/industries/education/payers?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank"><img src="https://more.flywire.com/rs/372-QSQ-649/images/flywire-map-gif.gif" alt="flywire-map-gif.gif" height="294" width="557" style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" /></a> 
<br /> 
<span style="text-decoration: underline; font-size: 22px; color: #ffffff;"><a href="https://www.flywire.com/industries/education/payers?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank" style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline;">View the interactive map</a></span> 
<span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #48b985; font-size: 22px;"><br /><br /></span> 
</div> 
</div></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" style="padding-top:23px;" class="em_ptop"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td width="8" align="left" valign="middle" style="font-size:0px; line-height:0px; width:8px;"> 
<div id="image_06" class="mktoImg"> 
<span style="vertical-align:-8px;"><img width="8" height="8" style="" border="0" /></span> 
</div></td> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="12" style="width:12px; font-size:0px; line-height:0px;">&nbsp;</td> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:16px; line-height:18px; color:#223341; font-weight:bold; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;" class="em_defaultlink"> 
<div id="text_017" class="mktoText"></div></td> 
