<tr class="mktoModule" id="Title_Of_the_Third_Copy"> 
<td align="center" valign="top"> 
<table width="640" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center" style="width:640px;" class="em_wrapper" bgcolor="#ffffff"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" class="em_ptrl2" style="padding:38px 40px 0px 40px;"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:24px; line-height:26px; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; color:#223341; padding-top:5px; font-weight:bold;" class="em_defaultlink"> 
<div id="text_09" class="mktoText"> 
<p style="text-align: center;">Missed our Global Payments &amp; Beyond Track? We’re bringing it to you <em>On Demand</em>!<br /><br /></p> 
</div></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:16px; line-height:24px; color:#223341; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; padding-top:15px;" class="em_defaultlink"> 
<div id="text_010" class="mktoText"> 
<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; color: #223341;">We’ll have all eight sessions from the <em>PDG Student Loans &amp; Financial Services Virtual Conference</em> available later this month, but you can view our</span><span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #48b985;"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><a href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/webinar-recording-addressing-the-affordability-crisis-with-flexible-payment-options?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank" style="color: #48b985; text-decoration: underline;"> <strong>Addressing the Affordability Crisis with Flexible Payment Options</strong></a></span></span><span style="font-size: 16px; color: #223341;"> featuring University of Pittsburgh and University of Virginia today!<br /><br /><br /><a href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/webinar-recording-addressing-the-affordability-crisis-with-flexible-payment-options?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank"><img src="https://more.flywire.com/rs/372-QSQ-649/images/View the recording Button %281%29.png" alt="View the recording Button (1).png" height="50" width="200" /></a></span></p> 
</div></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:16px; line-height:24px; color:#48B985; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; padding-top:17px;" class="em_green"> 
<div id="text_011" class="mktoText"></div></td> 
</tr> 
</tbody> 
</table></td> 
</tr> 
</tbody> 
</table></td> 
</tr>
